        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Jennifer Friedman",
        "text_sha256": "282d29d05dc0f4a960fefb0864f95b0169313c4d1c936ab98626128412e58dec",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "Jennifer Friedman, M.S., R.D.",
        "text_sha256": "b794c5a87d1139b15ef93268f6580a825333ae324c49358abf06a0c03a2a4660",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "About Jennifer Friedman, M.S., R.D.",
        "text_sha256": "4baa524c02541ce7e3c7614503dfdd72d312b2b784d744ebe873337957b5121a",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Jennifer Friedman is a registered dietitian who specializes in picky eating and pediatric feeding challenges. She works with parents and their children in her private practice, Jenny Friedman Nutrition .",
        "text_sha256": "1bda49adcb3eab475b4f3670aec1432d577d19db5685623f6ee4a0c8128a30be",
        "word_count": 30
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Friedman received a Bachelor of Arts degree from McGill University in Montreal, Canada, and a Master of Science degree in nutrition from Columbia University Teachers College in New York City.",
        "text_sha256": "9a68699c0749c50601bae6d6c1607effe63c0e15ac10857cea941209114a5006",
        "word_count": 30
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Other relevant positions",
        "text_sha256": "3cb35bf4b505f1c9652a309bbf062b6c5ebff2ba01239bd968b9ac137f401f2b",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Known for her child-led approachable style, Friedman is a leading resource for parents and professionals working with children who have limited diets and eating struggles.",
        "text_sha256": "9940f40f024f86d0ae178e009300e3d23528c1343bf8d5c07ae04243adf40da3",
        "word_count": 25
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "She is the author of Stories of Extreme Picky Eating: Children with Severe Eating Challenges and the Solutions that Helped Them .",
        "text_sha256": "79c5c324ce9aff4b5ffcff09b8aac76595cc3cd660f6ffc4aba883775bb01f03",
        "word_count": 22
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Friedman lives with her family in Philadelphia, Pennsylvania.",
        "text_sha256": "69fc9137250cbcbd373e56e754f0610b681a79dd34f1cfcc0b5d4ff786581792",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The educational health content on What To Expect is reviewed by our medical review board and team of experts to be up-to-date and in line with the latest evidence-based medical information and accepted health guidelines, including the medically reviewed What to Expect books by Heidi Murkoff. This educational content is not medical or diagnostic advice. Use of this site is subject to our terms of use and privacy policy . © 2005-2026 Everyday Health, Inc., a Ziff Davis company.",
        "text_sha256": "c423e7e136e9c8ebf39e668c5b1617d92d49cbd07ce74c8b1ec308c597fa3593",
        "word_count": 79
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Opens a new window",
        "text_sha256": "52b71e1a64c4aa4703a246e34de17b242088e4863ab032b365c12e07d7964633",
        "word_count": 4
      }
    ],
